{"ref":"BDB, אֵיבָה","hw":"אֵיבָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיבָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. enmity</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:15\" href=\"/Genesis.3.15\">Gn 3:15</a> + 2 textual; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיבַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.15\">Ez 25:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.5\">35:5</a>—<em>enmity</em>, personal hostility, betw. men <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:21\" href=\"/Numbers.35.21\">Nu 35:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:22\" href=\"/Numbers.35.22\">22</a> (P), betw. serpent & woman <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:15\" href=\"/Genesis.3.15\">Gn 3:15</a> (J), betw. peoples <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיבַת עוֹלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.15\">Ez 25:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.5\">35:5</a>.","next":"BDB, אִיּוֹב","prev":"BDB, אָיַב"}